  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing SRHR in Africa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiering av SRHR i Afrika</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Advance the availability of disaggregated, high-quality SRHR spending data to support policy decisions.
2) Strengthen cross-sectoral tracking of health and SRHR expenditures by leveraging public financial management systems.
3) Facilitate regional dialogues and platforms for accountability, learning, and translating evidence into action.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO&apos;s regional office for Africa will support countries to track and develop spending data, increase financial accountability and enhance regional learning</narrative>
